# The five self-lit scene backdrops the menu rotates over and the game plays in, plus the overlays and
# scatter they carry (the acacias, the campfire flame, the birds, the snow, the spray). Built out of the
# Testbed content directory like everything else, so the shared SceneRenderer draws the same scene in
# all three executables. The city needs no shader of its own - it is a technique in InstancedModel.fx.

#begin ../../Testbed/Content/Shaders/Sea.fx
/importer:EffectImporter
/processor:EffectProcessor
/processorParam:DebugMode=Auto
/build:../../Testbed/Content/Shaders/Sea.fx;Shaders/Sea.fx

